{
 "description": "Requires a ChainHelix API key as bearer token, or 2 cents per call paid over Binance b402 in USDT, USDC, USD1 or U on BNB Smart Chain, or over x402 in USDC on the Base network. Support and resistance price walls per chain with touch counts and strength, from hourly to weekly market structure, the same wall map the ChainHelix engine trades with: the five strongest levels on each side of price, and the nearest of them with its distance in percent. Omit chain for all nine",
